WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.608 --> 00:00:10.509
Teachers get a link to this page
from the faculty office.

2
00:00:10.609 --> 00:00:16.511
Email and kennitala – the kennitala
links the answer to the teacher.

3
00:00:16.611 --> 00:00:21.512
Only the teacher's own courses
are offered.

4
00:00:21.612 --> 00:00:27.514
Núverandi drög (current draft):
the course as it stands in Spoi.

5
00:00:27.614 --> 00:00:33.516
Weeks: choose all, then untick
the ones you do not teach.

6
00:00:33.616 --> 00:00:37.517
Times: one click = suits well.

7
00:00:37.617 --> 00:00:40.778
Two clicks = does not suit.

8
00:00:40.878 --> 00:00:45.780
Rooms the same way – “hentar ekki”
puts a room last.

9
00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:51.783
Kennarar: who teaches what –
PE the lectures, PT the dæmatímar.

10
00:00:51.883 --> 00:00:57.785
Any kind of session can be ticked,
even one the course lacks.

11
00:00:57.885 --> 00:01:04.899
Missing a teacher? Say so here.

12
00:01:04.999 --> 00:01:09.324
A note to the office.

13
00:01:09.424 --> 00:01:13.325
Yfirlit (summary): what will be sent.

14
00:01:13.425 --> 00:01:18.326
Send. It can be sent again –
the last answer counts.
